  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1202.52 Digital printing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1202.52 “Digital printing” means a method of printing in which an electronic output device transfers variable data, in the form of an image, from a computer to a substrate. The term includes inkjet printers.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
